          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.26.6+MAT.26.7+MAT.26.8+MAT.26.9+MAT.26.10+MAT.26.11+MAT.26.12+MAT.26.13"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mat 26:6-13",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MRK.14.3+MRK.14.4+MRK.14.5+MRK.14.6+MRK.14.7+MRK.14.8+MRK.14.9"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mak 14:3-9",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ku haabaire hatsigaireyo ebiro mukaaga okuhika aha Kuhingurwaho, Yesu yaija Besania, ahu Laazaaro, ou yaazoire omu bafu, yaabaire ari. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.12.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.12.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 12:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.10.40"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Luk 10:40",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Okwo baamuteekyerayo eby'okurya bya nyekiro; Mariza yaaheereza, Laazaaro akaba ari omwe aha baabaire bashutami na Yesu aha by'okurya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.12.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.12.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 12:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mariamu yaakwata eraatiri y'amajuta g'omugaju ag'obuguzi bwingi munonga; yaagasiiga aha bigyere bya Yesu, yaabisiisiriza eishokye rye, enju yoona yaataamirana emigaju. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.12.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.12.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 12:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwonka Yuda Iskaryota, omwe aha beegi be, owaabaire naayenda kumureebya, yaagira ati: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.12.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.12.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 12:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahabw'enki amajuta aga gataatundwa gakarugamu edenaari magana ashatu, zikagabirwa abooro? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.12.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.12.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 12:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.8.3"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Luk 8:3",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Taragambire atyo habw'okusaasira abooro; kureka akaba ari omushuma, kandi ahabw'okuba niwe yaabaire ahagatira enshaho, akaba atuura naakora aha byabaire biteebwamu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.12.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.12.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 12:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu yaagira ati: Mumurekye, agabiikire ekiro ky'okuziikwa kwangye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.12.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.12.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 12:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.15.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Bir 15:11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Abooro mutuura nabo obutoosha, kwonka nyowe timuriguma naanye obutoosha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.12.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.12.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 12:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abantu baingi omu Bayudaaya ku baamanyire ngu ari okwo, bajayo, ti habwa Yesu wenka, kureka ngu bareebe na Laazaaro, ou yaazoire omu bafu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.12.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.12.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 12:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abanyamurwa abakuru baahanuura kwita na Laazaaro; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.12.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.12.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 12:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ahabw'okuba ahabwe baingi aha Bayudaaya bakabarugamu, baikiriza Yesu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.12.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.12.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
