              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MRK.11.1+MRK.11.2+MRK.11.3+MRK.11.4+MRK.11.5+MRK.11.6+MRK.11.7+MRK.11.8+MRK.11.9+MRK.11.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mak 11:1-10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.19.29+LUK.19.30+LUK.19.31+LUK.19.32+LUK.19.33+LUK.19.34+LUK.19.35+LUK.19.36+LUK.19.37+LUK.19.38+LUK.19.39+LUK.19.40"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Luk 19:29-40",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ku bwaseesire, omutwe muhango gw'abantu, abaabaire baizire aha bugyenyi, ku baahuriire ngu Yesu naija Yerusaalemu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.12.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.12.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 12:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "baatwara amataagi g'enkindo, baaza kumubugana, nibeeshongora bati: Hosana! Orikwija omu iziina rya Mukama asiimwe, niwe Mugabe wa Israeli! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.12.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.12.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 12:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ZEC.9.9"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Zek 9:9",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Yesu, ku yaareebire omwana gw'endogoya, yaagutembaho, nk'oku kyahandiikirwe ngu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.12.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.12.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 12:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Otatiina, iwe Saayuuni, reeba Mukama waawe naija, atembire omwana gw'endogoya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.12.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.12.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 12:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JHN.7.39"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yoh 7:39",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Okubanza abeegi be tibarashoborokyeirwe ebyo; kwonka Yesu, ku yaaherize kuhimbisibwa, baabona kwijuka ngu ebyo byona bikamuhandiikwaho, kandi byamukorerwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.12.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.12.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 12:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi omutwe gw'abantu abaabaire bariho obu yaayeta Laazaaro okuruga omu kituuro, akamuzoora omu bafu, baabihamya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.12.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.12.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 12:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "N'ahabw'ekyo omutwe gw'abantu gwaza kumubugana, ahakuba bakaba bahuriire ku akozire akamanyiso ako. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.12.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.12.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 12:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abafarisaayo nikwo kugambirana bati: Mureebe ku mutakiine ky'okukora; reeba, ensi yoona yaamukuratira.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.12.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.12.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
